  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SMC(Seasonal Malaria Chemoprevention) IMPACT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To reduce the burden of malaria in the Sahel region of sub-Saharan Africa by: 1) increasing the impact of seasonal malaria chemoprevention (SMC), a World Health Organization (WHO)-endorsed malaria prevention strategy, and 2) introducing into key countries an additional artemisinin combination therapy (ACT) to complement existing therapeutic tools.</narrative>
  </description>
